{"id":"comble","lemma":"comble","pos":"noun","rank":4714,"glosses":["summit, peak (of a building)","pinnacle","overabundance; overload"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃bl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/92/Fr-comble.ogg/Fr-comble.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"combles"},"formAudio":{"combles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-combles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons fouillé la maison de fond en comble.","en":"We searched the house from top to bottom.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to search","l":"fouiller"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"house, home"},null,null,{"g":"in / of it"},null],"phrases":[[5,7,"in-depth"]]},{"text":"Pour comble de malheur, il tomba malade.","en":"To make things even worse, he got sick.","words":[{"g":"for"},null,null,null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to fall","l":"tomber"},{"g":"ill, sick"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"pesky, damn, bloody"]]},{"text":"Il y a beaucoup d'espace dans les combles pour stocker.","en":"There is plenty of space in the loft for storage.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"space"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to store while not in…"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]},{"text":"Est-ce que ce sous-sol a été fouillé de fond en comble ?","en":"Was this basement thoroughly searched?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"soil, earth"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to search","l":"fouiller"},null,null,{"g":"in / of it"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what"],[9,11,"in-depth"]]},{"text":"Pour comble de malheur, il commença à pleuvoir.","en":"To make matters worse, it began to rain.","words":[{"g":"for"},null,null,null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to rain"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"pesky, damn, bloody"]]}]}